In ONE sentence, summarize what this function does, for a codebase doc-tree (name the behavior + the edge case it guards). Code:
```js
function gateCheck({caps, spent, price, maxTokens}){
  if(caps.frozen) return {allow:false, reason:'frozen'};
  if(!price) return {allow:false, reason:'unknown-price'};
  const est=(maxTokens/1e6)*price.outPerMtok;
  if(spent.lifetimeUsd+est > caps.lifetimeCapUsd) return {allow:false, reason:'lifetime-cap'};
  return {allow:true};
}
```
